## The shcl.py files the Python wrapper is checked against: the commit, and
## the file's sha256. cicd/cicd.bash fetches 3.0's by commit into cicd/cache/
## and refuses a file that doesn't match. 3.0 is the same commit Go, Rust, and
## C pin.
